o the response Copy control, confirm its selector, then run the clipboard helper.Copy control is `button[aria-label=\"복사\"]`. I’ll save the completion snapshot, then capture the response through the clipboard helper.I’ll now click the observed response Copy button inside the clipboard helper and save only the helper-verified bytes.Clipboard capture succeeded. I’ll verify the helper files, update the receipt, then close the task space.Capture is verified. I’ll mark the receipt complete, then close the task space in a dedicated final heredoc.Gemini transport completed. The plan was not written here.\n\n- **Route:** gemini-web · **mode:** Pro Extended (`확장된 사고 모델`)\n- **Conversation:** https://gemini.google.com/app/65dd1b470ea389dd?hl=ko\n- **Task space:** 1 (`gemini-web-daily-planning-20260908`), closed after capture\n- **Submit:** `input.md` uploaded once; Korean follow-attachment request sent once\n- **Capture:** observed response Copy (`button[aria-label=\"복사\"]`) + `planning-clipboard.py`; UI evidence `클립보드에 복사됨`\n- **Output:** `plan.md` · 21277 bytes · SHA256 `42d69fc2cf0d40e3ece7afc14e9e6b7ffe068d7885709693e90822dc9852d2ba`\n- **Receipt:** `web-receipt.json` status `complete` · helper `plan.md.4698.receipt.json` · snapshot `web-snapshot.txt`\n- **Token usage:** unknown (not displayed)",
